  "merge_provenance": {
    "note": "eee7e6a (perf/p6-fa2-dense tip, the flash arm) merged LOCALLY into bench/esc045-torch-column@29cd6f9 (the --lora-init/torch-column apparatus) -- NOT pushed to origin. This was necessary, not merely convenient: eee7e6a's own grad_oracle.rs has no --lora-init flag at all (46abf91, which adds it, is not an ancestor of eee7e6a), so run_esc045_torch_column.sh cannot run against the bare FA2 tip -- confirmed by trying (`error: unexpected argument '--lora-init' found`) before merging. The merge itself touched exactly one file (crates/jammi-bench/src/grad_oracle.rs); the sole conflict was two citation-line-number edits to the SAME doc-table row (both branches had independently shifted torch_grad_oracle.py/finetune_step.rs line numbers elsewhere) -- resolved by keeping the esc045 branch's citations and re-deriving the one finetune_step.rs line number (sha256_and_len) that actually moved post-merge (verified by grep, not guessed). Every other file auto-merged clean.",
